            </motion.p>
            <motion.p variants={fadeUp}>
              <strong><a href="https://blog.pivotal.io/big-data-pivotal/features/20-examples-of-roi-and-results-with-big-data" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Delta</a>:</strong>{" "}
              Tracks over 130 million checked bags a year and was the first major airline to offer
