            </motion.p>
            <motion.p variants={fadeUp}>
              <strong><a href="https://www.fastcompany.com/3034748/worth-the-risk/how-evolv-is-arming-companies-with-predictive-data-on-employees" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Evolv</a>:</strong>{" "}
              Analyzes hundreds of millions of external data points to help large employers predict
