            </motion.p>
            <motion.p variants={fadeUp}>
              <strong><a href="https://paulchaffey.blogspot.com/2014/04/verdens-10-mest-innovative-innen-big.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">General Electric</a>:</strong>{" "}
              Analyzes operating data from machines like power plants and locomotives to squeeze out
