            </motion.p>
            <motion.p variants={fadeUp}>
              <strong><a href="http://www.cioinsight.com/it-strategy/big-data/slideshows/11-great-things-companies-are-doing-with-big-data.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Google</a>:</strong>{" "}
              Partnered with the CDC to track flu-related search terms and help predict regional
